  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Helping Farmers Grow to Surplus and Resilience</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">One Acre Fund aims to improve the livelihoods of 7.5M Africa&#x2019;s smallholder farmers by 2027. We will do this by growing our full-service core program to reach 3 million farmers, and our private and public sector partnerships unit to reach 4.5 million farmers. Transformative funding support from DGIS is helping us to pursue this ambitious growth plan, and unlock $3.1 billion in cumulative farmer impact (increases in farmer income) across the core program and partnerships over 2023-2027.</narrative>
  </description>
  <participating-org ref="XM-DAC-7" role="1" type="10">
